cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Observation-Validated Rainfall–Runoff Modelling with GR4J (Murray River at Upper Murray, 114001A)"
abstract: >-
  A hydrology-first study of GR4J calibration, parameter equifinality, and
  transferability for CAMELS-AUS gauge 114001A, using a self-coded GR4J model,
  a Differential Evolution baseline, a respawning speciation-based PSO (RS-SPSO)
  for multimodal calibration, and a Klemeš (1986) differential split-sample test.
type: software
authors:
